OL,3,ACentrica boss 'hugely concerned' over
OL,4,Aimpact of soaring energy bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has said some households
OL,7,Fwill get #100 to help with energy
OL,8,Fbills, but Citizens Advice said it was
OL,9,Fa "drop in the ocean" while one
OL,10,Fpressure group called for action on
OL,11,F"inflated energy firm profits".
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
