OL,3,ASouth Korea education minister resigns
OL,4,Aover exam cheating scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Korea's Education Minister Choi
OL,7,FKyo-jin has resigned over an exam
OL,8,Fcheating scandal that shocked the
OL,9,Fnation.
OL,11,FHe said he took full responsibility for
OL,12,Fthe confusion caused by last-minute
OL,13,Fmeasures aimed at stopping AI-assisted
OL,14,Fcheating during Thursday's annual
OL,15,Fcollege entrance exam, known as
OL,16,FSuneung.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
