OL,3,ASouth Korea education minister resigns
OL,4,Aover exam cheating scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA week ago, the top scorer in the
OL,7,Fnational tax accountancy exam admitted
OL,8,Fusing a mini-camera, mobile phone and
OL,9,FAI tools. This prompted officials to
OL,10,Fact urgently to detect hidden devices,
OL,11,Fincluding sending emergency alerts to
OL,12,Fevery single mobile phone in the
OL,13,Fcountry.
OL,15,FThe Suneung takes up to nine hours to
OL,16,Fcomplete, and it plays a big role in
OL,17,Fcareer trajectories of millions of
OL,18,FSouth Koreans.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
